RESPONSIBLE USE

Yaragon is an offensive-security tool for authorized MITM network investigation.
Use it ONLY on networks and systems that you own or are explicitly authorized to
test, ideally within an isolated laboratory environment. The author does not
condone and is not responsible for any misuse. Using Yaragon to intercept or
disrupt traffic on networks you do not own or have permission to test may be
illegal.
